WHAT DOES AI DO?

- Artificial intelligence machines(researchers call the "AI Services") don't think. They calculate.
    They represent some of the newest and most sophisticated calculating machines in the human history.
    Some can perform what's called Machine learning as they acquire new data.
    Others, using calculations arranged in ways inspired by neurons in the human brain, can even
    perform deep learning with multiple levels of calculations.

